{
  "description": "Notification policy alert types and filters the spec omits, verified live on 2026-10-23. GET /accounts/{account_id}/alerting/v3/available_alerts lists workers_observability_alert, workers_observability_real_time_issue (the policy a Workers Issues automation notifies), log_explorer_scheduled_query_results_alert and log_explorer_ingest_rate_limit, none of which are in the alert_type enum (also absent from cloudflare/forge openapi@37b001d). The custom_analytics filter_options list the SQL custom-alert keys (source=sql_api, execution_interval, alert_trigger_preferences_operator/short_window/long_window/minimum_threshold) that PolicyFilter lacks; a disabled custom_analytics policy with a SQL API selector was created, read back with identical filters, and deleted. Cloudflare validates the selector against the SQL API (error 17203). Rejections seen while probing are typed: code 17501 (invalid filter field) and 17203 (SQL API rejected the query).",
